{"id":"5341f44ba0b06e12","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-unrestricted-grammar.md","title":"原书的一般短语结构文法","display":"df-unrestricted-grammar — 原书的一般短语结构文法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-unrestricted-grammar","aliases":["73-df-unrestricted-grammar"],"display":"df-unrestricted-grammar — 原书的一般短语结构文法","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§9.2, p. 220; scan 228","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§9.2, p. 220; scan 228","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-unrestricted-grammar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-unrestricted-grammar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unrestricted-grammar — 原书的一般短语结构文法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.2, p. 220; scan 228"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§9.2, p. 220; scan 228"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是候选四元组，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是非终结符集。此处按原书 §9.2 的文字定义仅要求产生式左部非空，不额外要求左部一定含非终结符。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,P,S\\;[G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land S\\in V\\land P\\subseteq(V\\cup\\Sigma)^+\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land|P|&lt;\\aleph_0]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,P,S\\;[G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land S\\in V\\land P\\subseteq(V\\cup\\Sigma)^+\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land|P|&lt;\\aleph_0]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\operatorname{UG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\operatorname{UG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>一般产生式的两个分量都是词；与 CFG 中左部是单个字符的类型不同。保留原书容许的广义非空左部；若采用另一些教材要求左部含变量的约定，需要另立变体，不能混作相同签名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$G$ 是候选四元组，见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。$V$ 是非终结符集。此处按原书 §9.2 的文字定义仅要求产生式左部非空，不额外要求左部一定含非终结符。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,P,S\\;[G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\land V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\land S\\in V\\land P\\subseteq(V\\cup\\Sigma)^+\\times(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\land|P|<\\aleph_0]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\operatorname{UG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1941,"backlinks":[{"id":"92ebdfbfd367298c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-unrestricted-grammar]]；$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$。有限路径闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-unrestricted-grammar|原书的一般短语结构文法]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}